1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,701
One thing to be clear about.

2
00:00:01,701 --> 00:00:09,097
Section two six eight gives the insurer twenty business days to issue a policy once the risk is accepted.

3
00:00:09,097 --> 00:00:13,917
Delivering it within twenty days of it reaching the branch is not the Act.

4
00:00:13,917 --> 00:00:15,644
That standard is ours.

